### Release deploy package ###
# Bundled runtimes - ~600 MB of third-party binaries. Recreate them with the
# downloads listed in release/deploy-package/README.md instead of committing them.
release/deploy-package/lib/jdk/
release/deploy-package/lib/mysql/
release/deploy-package/lib/redis/
# Built by bin\env.bat on first run from the values in bin\env.bat itself
release/deploy-package/conf/my.ini
release/deploy-package/conf/redis.conf
# Runtime data - never commit (logs/ is already covered above)
release/deploy-package/data/
# Build artifacts (rebuild with Maven / pnpm, see deploy-package README) -
# also required: GitHub rejects single files larger than 100 MB
release/deploy-package/lib/*.jar
release/*.zip

